    "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd two additive PerfModel map aliases for GLM-5.3 decode ops that were previously unmapped:\n\n- `sglang_profiler::communication_op_tensor_model_parallel_fused_allreduce_rmsnorm` → `aiter_fused_allreduce_rmsnorm_`\n- `sglang_profiler::moe_sorting_small__run_small_sort` → `MoeSortScatterGather`\n\nVerified against glm53 decode `Input Dims`. Additive keys only; no behavior change to existing mappings.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Unit tests in `tests/test_perfmodel_extensions.py` for the new alias keys\n- [ ] Smoke: glm53 decode report shows both ops with `has_perf_model=True`",
    "changed_files": 2,
